cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this code, please cite the manuscript (preferred citation) and this software."
type: software
title: "breast-cancer-bmi-signatures: code for 'Deep Learning Identifies BMI-Associated Morphologic Features in Breast Cancer Tissue'"
version: "1.0.0"
license: MIT
repository-code: "https://github.com/eitm-org/breast-cancer-bmi-signatures"
abstract: >-
  Analysis code for the manuscript: tile-level cellular-density clustering,
  inter-patient heterogeneity (distance metrics) and high- vs. low-BMI
  classification from histopathology slide vectors of breast cancer patients.
keywords:
  - computational pathology
  - breast cancer
  - body mass index
  - foundation model embeddings
